addLang("fr", {"{master} turns your token over. Its back bears eleven marks, one for each crown, and a twelfth mark scratched out. “The Ashen Century did not end with a victory,” the Huntmaster says. “The eleven Sealers bound the Blot beneath their lands, then made a pact never to let one crown rule the whole page. Now the bindings are thinning. {hero} sealed the danger beneath {kingdom}. You must go below, learn what is waking, and return alive.”":"{master} retourne ton jeton. Au dos, onze marques, une pour chaque couronne, et une douzième rayée. « Le Siècle des Cendres ne s’est pas achevé par une victoire, dit le Maître-chasseur. Les onze Scelleurs ont lié la Tache sous leurs terres, puis juré qu’aucune couronne ne régnerait sur toute la page. À présent, les liens s’amenuisent. {hero} a scellé le danger sous {kingdom}. Tu dois descendre, découvrir ce qui s’éveille et revenir vivant. »","Break {boss}’s Seal in the {seal}, in {kingdom}.":"Brise le Sceau de {boss} dans {seal}, en {kingdom}."});
addLang("es", {"{master} turns your token over. Its back bears eleven marks, one for each crown, and a twelfth mark scratched out. “The Ashen Century did not end with a victory,” the Huntmaster says. “The eleven Sealers bound the Blot beneath their lands, then made a pact never to let one crown rule the whole page. Now the bindings are thinning. {hero} sealed the danger beneath {kingdom}. You must go below, learn what is waking, and return alive.”":"{master} da la vuelta a tu medallón. En el reverso hay once marcas, una por cada corona, y una duodécima tachada. «El Siglo de Ceniza no terminó con una victoria», dice el maestro cazador. «Los once Selladores ataron la Mancha bajo sus tierras y juraron que ninguna corona gobernaría toda la página. Ahora los vínculos se debilitan. {hero} selló el peligro bajo {kingdom}. Debes bajar, descubrir qué está despertando y regresar con vida».","Break {boss}’s Seal in the {seal}, in {kingdom}.":"Rompe el Sello de {boss} en {seal}, en {kingdom}."});
addLang("pt", {"{master} turns your token over. Its back bears eleven marks, one for each crown, and a twelfth mark scratched out. “The Ashen Century did not end with a victory,” the Huntmaster says. “The eleven Sealers bound the Blot beneath their lands, then made a pact never to let one crown rule the whole page. Now the bindings are thinning. {hero} sealed the danger beneath {kingdom}. You must go below, learn what is waking, and return alive.”":"{master} vira a tua moeda. No verso há onze marcas, uma por cada coroa, e uma décima segunda riscada. «O Século das Cinzas não terminou com uma vitória», diz o Mestre Caçador. «Os onze Seladores prenderam a Mancha sob as suas terras e fizeram um pacto para que nenhuma coroa governasse a página inteira. Agora, os vínculos estão a enfraquecer. {hero} selou o perigo sob {kingdom}. Tens de descer, descobrir o que está a despertar e regressar vivo.»","Break {boss}’s Seal in the {seal}, in {kingdom}.":"Quebra o Selo de {boss} em {seal}, em {kingdom}."});
addLang("ja", {"{master} turns your token over. Its back bears eleven marks, one for each crown, and a twelfth mark scratched out. “The Ashen Century did not end with a victory,” the Huntmaster says. “The eleven Sealers bound the Blot beneath their lands, then made a pact never to let one crown rule the whole page. Now the bindings are thinning. {hero} sealed the danger beneath {kingdom}. You must go below, learn what is waking, and return alive.”":"{master}は君の印章を裏返した。裏には王冠ごとに一つ、十一の印があり、十二番目の印は削られている。「灰の世紀は勝利で終わったのではない」と狩人頭は言う。「十一人の封印者は各地の地下にブロットを封じ、どの王冠も世界全体を支配しないと誓った。だが今、その封印が弱まっている。{hero}は{kingdom}の地下に危険を封じた。下へ行き、目覚めつつあるものを確かめ、生きて戻るのだ。」","Break {boss}’s Seal in the {seal}, in {kingdom}.":"{kingdom}の{seal}で{boss}の封印を破ろう。"});
addLang("zh", {"{master} turns your token over. Its back bears eleven marks, one for each crown, and a twelfth mark scratched out. “The Ashen Century did not end with a victory,” the Huntmaster says. “The eleven Sealers bound the Blot beneath their lands, then made a pact never to let one crown rule the whole page. Now the bindings are thinning. {hero} sealed the danger beneath {kingdom}. You must go below, learn what is waking, and return alive.”":"{master}把你的信物翻了过来。背面有十一道印记，每顶王冠一道，还有一道被划掉的第十二道印记。“灰烬世纪并非以胜利告终，”猎人首领说道。“十一位封印者将墨魇封在各自领地之下，并立誓绝不让任何一顶王冠统治整篇世界。如今封印正在变弱。{hero}将危险封在了{kingdom}地下。你必须深入下方，查明正在苏醒之物，然后活着回来。”","Break {boss}’s Seal in the {seal}, in {kingdom}.":"在{kingdom}的{seal}打破{boss}的封印。"});
