addLang('fr', { 'The First Line': 'La première ligne', 'Before anything, there was only the white. Then the First Scribe drew a single line, and the line became the horizon. Above it the Scribe left the sky empty. Below it the Scribe drew mountains, rivers and the long coasts, and wherever the ink touched, the land remembered it.': 'Avant toute chose, il n’y avait que le blanc. Puis le Premier Scribe traça une ligne, qui devint l’horizon. Au-dessus, il laissa le ciel vide. En dessous, il dessina montagnes, rivières et longues côtes ; partout où l’encre touchait, la terre s’en souvenait.', 'Reading it aloud, you feel the world grow a little more solid around you.': 'En le lisant à voix haute, tu sens le monde se solidifier un peu autour de toi.' });
addLang('es', { 'The First Line': 'La primera línea', 'Before anything, there was only the white. Then the First Scribe drew a single line, and the line became the horizon. Above it the Scribe left the sky empty. Below it the Scribe drew mountains, rivers and the long coasts, and wherever the ink touched, the land remembered it.': 'Antes de todo, solo existía el blanco. Entonces el Primer Escriba trazó una línea, y esta se convirtió en el horizonte. Sobre ella dejó vacío el cielo. Debajo dibujó montañas, ríos y largas costas; allí donde tocaba la tinta, la tierra lo recordaba.', 'Reading it aloud, you feel the world grow a little more solid around you.': 'Al leerlo en voz alta, sientes que el mundo se vuelve un poco más sólido a tu alrededor.' });
addLang('pt', { 'The First Line': 'A primeira linha', 'Before anything, there was only the white. Then the First Scribe drew a single line, and the line became the horizon. Above it the Scribe left the sky empty. Below it the Scribe drew mountains, rivers and the long coasts, and wherever the ink touched, the land remembered it.': 'Antes de tudo, só existia o branco. Então o Primeiro Escriba traçou uma linha, e ela tornou-se o horizonte. Acima dela, deixou o céu vazio. Abaixo, desenhou montanhas, rios e longas costas; onde quer que a tinta tocasse, a terra lembrava-se.', 'Reading it aloud, you feel the world grow a little more solid around you.': 'Ao leres em voz alta, sentes o mundo tornar-se um pouco mais sólido à tua volta.' });
addLang('ja', { 'The First Line': '最初の線', 'Before anything, there was only the white. Then the First Scribe drew a single line, and the line became the horizon. Above it the Scribe left the sky empty. Below it the Scribe drew mountains, rivers and the long coasts, and wherever the ink touched, the land remembered it.': '何もない頃、そこにあったのは白だけだった。やがて最初の書記が一本の線を引き、それは地平線となった。書記はその上に空を空白のまま残し、下には山々や川、長い海岸線を描いた。墨が触れた場所を、大地は忘れなかった。', 'Reading it aloud, you feel the world grow a little more solid around you.': '声に出して読むと、世界が少しずつ確かなものになっていく気がした。' });
addLang('zh', { 'The First Line': '第一道线', 'Before anything, there was only the white. Then the First Scribe drew a single line, and the line became the horizon. Above it the Scribe left the sky empty. Below it the Scribe drew mountains, rivers and the long coasts, and wherever the ink touched, the land remembered it.': '万物诞生之前，天地间只有一片空白。后来，初代书吏画下一道线，那道线成了地平线。书吏让线上方的天空保持空白，在下方画出山脉、河流和绵长的海岸。墨迹触及之处，大地便记住了一切。', 'Reading it aloud, you feel the world grow a little more solid around you.': '你朗读着文字，感觉周围的世界变得更加真实了一些。' });
