addLang('ja', { 'Ruin of the Quill': '羽根ペンの遺跡', 'Ruin of Scriptoria': 'スクリプトリアの遺跡', 'You have already read the stone here. The words stay with you.': 'ここの石碑はもう読んだ。言葉は今も心に残っている。' });
addLang('zh', { 'Ruin of the Quill': '羽笔遗迹', 'Ruin of Scriptoria': '斯克里普托里亚遗迹', 'You have already read the stone here. The words stay with you.': '你已经读过这里的石碑。那些文字仍留在你心中。' });

addLang("fr", {"You wake in a small house at the edge of {village}. The bed is warm, the door is new, and nobody remembers the house being built—or remembers you. On the table lies a hunter’s token and a note in an unknown hand: “Go to {capital}. Find the Huntmaster. Say their names.” Outside, a bell rings once though the village has no bell tower. In the dust beneath the table, eleven tiny crowns have been drawn around a white circle.":"Tu te réveilles dans une petite maison, à la lisière de {village}. Le lit est chaud, la porte est neuve, et personne ne se souvient de la construction de cette maison — ni de toi. Sur la table reposent un jeton de chasseur et une note écrite d’une main inconnue : « Va à {capital}. Trouve le Maître-chasseur. Dis leurs noms. » Dehors, une cloche sonne une fois, bien que le village n’ait pas de clocher. Dans la poussière sous la table, onze petites couronnes entourent un cercle blanc.","Find {master} at the Hunters’ Lodge in {capital}, capital of {kingdom}.":"Trouve {master} au Pavillon des chasseurs de {capital}, capitale de {kingdom}."});
addLang("es", {"You wake in a small house at the edge of {village}. The bed is warm, the door is new, and nobody remembers the house being built—or remembers you. On the table lies a hunter’s token and a note in an unknown hand: “Go to {capital}. Find the Huntmaster. Say their names.” Outside, a bell rings once though the village has no bell tower. In the dust beneath the table, eleven tiny crowns have been drawn around a white circle.":"Despiertas en una casita a las afueras de {village}. La cama está caliente, la puerta es nueva y nadie recuerda que construyeran la casa… ni se acuerda de ti. Sobre la mesa hay una ficha de cazador y una nota escrita con letra desconocida: «Ve a {capital}. Encuentra al maestro cazador. Di sus nombres». Fuera suena una campana, aunque el pueblo no tiene campanario. En el polvo bajo la mesa, once pequeñas coronas rodean un círculo blanco.","Find {master} at the Hunters’ Lodge in {capital}, capital of {kingdom}.":"Encuentra a {master} en el Pabellón de Cazadores de {capital}, capital de {kingdom}."});
addLang("pt", {"You wake in a small house at the edge of {village}. The bed is warm, the door is new, and nobody remembers the house being built—or remembers you. On the table lies a hunter’s token and a note in an unknown hand: “Go to {capital}. Find the Huntmaster. Say their names.” Outside, a bell rings once though the village has no bell tower. In the dust beneath the table, eleven tiny crowns have been drawn around a white circle.":"Acordas numa pequena casa à entrada de {village}. A cama está quente, a porta é nova e ninguém se lembra de a casa ter sido construída — nem de ti. Sobre a mesa estão uma moeda de caçador e um bilhete escrito por uma mão desconhecida: «Vai a {capital}. Encontra o Mestre Caçador. Diz os nomes deles.» Lá fora, um sino toca uma vez, embora a aldeia não tenha torre sineira. No pó debaixo da mesa, onze pequenas coroas foram desenhadas em redor de um círculo branco.","Find {master} at the Hunters’ Lodge in {capital}, capital of {kingdom}.":"Encontra {master} no Pavilhão dos Caçadores em {capital}, capital de {kingdom}."});
addLang("ja", {"You wake in a small house at the edge of {village}. The bed is warm, the door is new, and nobody remembers the house being built—or remembers you. On the table lies a hunter’s token and a note in an unknown hand: “Go to {capital}. Find the Huntmaster. Say their names.” Outside, a bell rings once though the village has no bell tower. In the dust beneath the table, eleven tiny crowns have been drawn around a white circle.":"{village}のはずれにある小さな家で目を覚ました。ベッドは温かく、扉は新しい。だが誰も、この家を建てたことも、君のことも覚えていない。テーブルには狩人の印章と、見知らぬ筆跡のメモがある。「{capital}へ行け。狩人頭を探せ。彼らの名を告げよ。」外では、村に鐘楼がないのに鐘が一度鳴った。テーブルの下の埃には、白い円を囲む十一の小さな王冠が描かれていた。","Find {master} at the Hunters’ Lodge in {capital}, capital of {kingdom}.":"{kingdom}の都{capital}にある狩人の館で、{master}を探そう。"});
addLang("zh", {"You wake in a small house at the edge of {village}. The bed is warm, the door is new, and nobody remembers the house being built—or remembers you. On the table lies a hunter’s token and a note in an unknown hand: “Go to {capital}. Find the Huntmaster. Say their names.” Outside, a bell rings once though the village has no bell tower. In the dust beneath the table, eleven tiny crowns have been drawn around a white circle.":"你在{village}边上的一间小屋里醒来。床铺温暖，房门崭新，可没人记得这屋子是何时建成的——也没人记得你。桌上放着一枚猎人信物，还有一张陌生笔迹的纸条：“去{capital}。找到猎人首领。说出他们的名字。”屋外的钟响了一声，尽管村里没有钟楼。桌下的灰尘里，十一顶小王冠围着一个白色圆圈。","Find {master} at the Hunters’ Lodge in {capital}, capital of {kingdom}.":"前往{kingdom}的首都{capital}，在猎人公馆找到{master}。"});
