'The cadejo is a great dog with glowing red eyes and hooves like a goat, that appears to people walking alone at night. There are two: the white cadejo, a guardian sent to protect travellers on the road, and the black cadejo, a demon that follows drunks and sinners to lead them to their death. People who walk home late often tell of a large silent dog that walked beside them until they reached their door.':'El cadejo es un perro enorme de ojos rojos brillantes y pezuñas de cabra que aparece ante quienes caminan solos de noche. Hay dos: el cadejo blanco, guardián que protege a los viajeros, y el negro, un demonio que sigue a borrachos y pecadores hasta conducirlos a la muerte. Quienes vuelven tarde suelen contar que un perro grande y silencioso los acompañó hasta casa.',
