'Baigujing, the White Bone Demon, was a skeleton who became a demon after a thousand years. In ‘Journey to the West’, she wants to eat the monk Tang Sanzang, because his flesh can make her immortal. She disguises herself three times: as a young girl, an old woman and an old man. Each time the Monkey King Sun Wukong sees through the trick and strikes her, but the monk believes he has killed innocent people and sends Monkey away.':'Baigujing, o Demónio dos Ossos Brancos, era um esqueleto que se tornou demónio após mil anos. Em «Jornada para o Oeste», quer comer o monge Tang Sanzang, pois a carne dele pode torná-la imortal. Disfarça-se três vezes: de jovem, de velha e de velho. De cada vez, o Rei Macaco Sun Wukong percebe o truque e ataca-a, mas o monge acredita que matou inocentes e expulsa o Macaco.',
